      "content": "{name} 선수와 오락실에 갔다.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "You went to the arcade with {name}.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "084eed26-89cc-5ac5-81f0-c7f11799d694",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 4,
      "x": 640,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "감독님 현역 때 실력 보여 주세요!",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Show me what you had back in your pro days, Coach!",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ed24f1d3-9ce7-5c7d-a219-714727b58a2a",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 5,
      "x": 940,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": null,
      "content": "결과는 아슬아슬한 감독님 승.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "The result: a razor-thin win for the coach.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "42fed33f-397a-51e3-9004-bdf4b1b01221",
      "type": "Comment",
      "name": "Comment",
      "localId": 6,
      "x": 340,
      "y": -220,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "text": "외출 이벤트 설정",
      "width": 260,
      "height": 110,
